AIGW  Portable installation
────────────────────────────────────────
  ✓ Installed $WORK/bin/aigw
  PATH is unchanged. Use the installed path directly, or add its directory to PATH before running the command below.

Next
  aigw setup
-- blocker.txt --
A file where the installation needs a folder.
-- refusal.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  portable AIGW file $WORK is a directory; name the program file

Fix
  Run `aigw install --path $WORK/aigw` with this same program; `aigw` on PATH may be another program.
